---
import Layout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Mind Arc Games">
  <main class="privacy-page">
    <div class="privacy-shell">
      <section class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Mind Arc Games</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Mind Arc Network, Games, and Online Services
        </p>
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: August8, 2026</p>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-panel">
        <p>
          Mind Arc Games ("we," "our," or "us") respects your privacy. This
          Privacy Policy explains how information is collected, used, stored,
          and protected when you use the
          <strong>Mind Arc Network</strong>, our websites, games, applications,
          and online services, including
          <strong>Phoenix Vector: Assault</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          By creating a Mind Arc Network account or using our services, you
          acknowledge this Privacy Policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

        <p>
          We collect only the information reasonably necessary to provide,
          maintain, and improve our services.
        </p>

        <p>This information may include:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Email address</li>
          <li>Mind Arc ID (username)</li>
          <li>Account authentication information</li>
          <li>Selected profile avatar</li>
          <li>Game progression and cloud save data</li>
          <li>Achievements, statistics, and leaderboard information</li>
          <li>Support requests or feedback you voluntarily submit</li>
          <li>Device information such as operating system and browser type</li>
          <li>Crash reports and diagnostic information</li>
          <li>Gameplay analytics used to improve our games</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How We Use Information</h2>

        <p>We use collected information to:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Create and manage your Mind Arc Network account.</li>
          <li>Authenticate your identity.</li>
          <li>Save your game progress.</li>
          <li>Provide online features.</li>
          <li>Improve gameplay balance and performance.</li>
          <li>Respond to support requests.</li>
          <li>Protect the security and integrity of our services.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Mind Arc Network Accounts</h2>

        <p>
          Your Mind Arc Network account provides access to online features
          across Mind Arc Games titles.
        </p>

        <p>
          As new games and services are released, your account may be used to
          synchronize progression, achievements, cosmetics, and other
          account-related features.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>

        <p>
          We may rely on trusted third-party providers to operate our services.
          These providers process information only as needed to perform their
          services.
        </p>

        <p>Examples may include:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Supabase (authentication and database services)</li>
          <li>Google Play Services</li>
          <li>Apple App Store</li>
          <li>Steam (future releases)</li>
          <li>Analytics providers</li>
          <li>Cloud hosting providers</li>
          <li>Payment processors (if applicable)</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          These providers maintain their own privacy policies governing their
          services.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies and Website Data</h2>

        <p>
          Our website may use cookies or similar technologies to improve
          functionality, remember preferences, and understand how visitors use
          our website.
        </p>

        <p>
          You may configure your browser to refuse cookies, although some
          features may not function correctly.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>

        <p>
          We use reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect
          your information from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, or
          destruction.
        </p>

        <p>
          While we strive to protect your information, no method of electronic
          storage or transmission over the Internet is completely secure.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Retention</h2>

        <p>
          We retain account information only as long as reasonably necessary to
          operate our services, comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes,
          and enforce our agreements.
        </p>

        <h2>Your Choices</h2>

        <p>
          You may request deletion of your Mind Arc Network account by
          contacting us.
        </p>

        <p>
          Certain information may be retained where required by law or for
          legitimate business purposes such as fraud prevention or dispute
          resolution.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>

        <p>
          Our services are not intended for children under the minimum age
          required by applicable law without parental permission. We do not
          knowingly collect personal information from children in violation of
          applicable laws.
        </p>

        <h2>International Users</h2>

        <p>
          Depending on where you live, your information may be stored or
          processed in countries other than your own. We take reasonable steps
          to protect personal information regardless of where it is processed.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Updated versions
          will be posted on this page together with a revised "Last Updated"
          date.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>

        <p>
          If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal
          information, please contact us.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <p><strong>Mind Arc Games</strong></p>

          <p>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:contact@mindarcgames.com">
              contact@mindarcgames.com
            </a>
          </p>

          <p>
            Website:
            <a
              href="https://mindarcgames.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              https://mindarcgames.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #040814;
    --bg-soft: rgba(10, 18, 36, 0.82);
    --panel-border: rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.18);
    --text: #dbe7f5;
    --text-soft: #9fb2c9;
    --heading: #f8fbff;
    --cyan: #67e8f9;
    --cyan-strong: #22d3ee;
    --gold: #ffc857;
    --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
  }

  .privacy-page {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 5rem 1.25rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top center,
        rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.12),
        transparent 28%
      ),
      radial-gradient(
        circle at 20% 20%,
        rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.08),
        transparent 18%
      ),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #081120 0%, #040814 55%, #02050d 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .privacy-page::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 36px 36px;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45),
      rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08)
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .privacy-shell {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    padding: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.28em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--cyan);
  }

  .hero h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--heading);
    text-shadow:
      0 0 18px rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.12),
      0 0 40px rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.08);
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    margin: 1rem 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--gold);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .last-updated {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-soft);
  }

  .policy-panel {
    position: relative;
    padding: 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--panel-border);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(14, 25, 47, 0.88),
      rgba(7, 13, 26, 0.94)
    );
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .policy-panel::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(
      135deg,
      rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.35),
      rgba(255, 200, 87, 0.18),
      rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.1)
    );
    -webkit-mask:
      linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box,
      linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);
    -webkit-mask-composite: xor;
    mask-composite: exclude;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .policy-panel p,
  .policy-panel li {
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.85;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .policy-panel p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .policy-panel h2 {
    margin: 2rem 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--heading);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .policy-panel h2::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 26px;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--cyan), var(--gold));
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.35);
  }

  .policy-panel ul {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .policy-panel li {
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .policy-panel strong {
    color: var(--heading);
  }

  .policy-panel a {
    color: var(--cyan);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition:
      color 0.2s ease,
      text-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .policy-panel a:hover {
    color: #a5f3fc;
    text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.22);
  }

  .contact-card {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(103, 232, 249, 0.14);
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02)
    );
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .privacy-page {
      padding: 3rem 1rem;
    }

    .policy-panel {
      padding: 1.4rem;
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .policy-panel::before {
      border-radius: 18px;
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }
</style>
